Package: cage-tenant-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cage contributors <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi (>= 3.42), gir1.2-gtk-3.0 (>= 3.24), gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 (>= 2.40)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sweetcornna/Claude-Cage-Tenant
Description: Cage multi-tenant portal client (GTK and WebKitGTK)
 Cage Tenant shows a Cage multi-tenant portal in its own window. The portal
 and its virtual machines run on a Linux Incus server deployed by an
 administrator; this package does not run virtual machines or Incus.
 .
 The HTTPS portal address is entered and changed in the window and is the
 only value the client saves. Each portal server gets its own WebKit
 session, which is deleted when the server is changed or cleared.
